cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this development version, cite the exact commit as well as this metadata. Release qualification remains pending."
type: software
title: "innovate: Rust-native innovation and policy diffusion modelling"
abstract: >
  innovate models innovation adoption, technology substitution, competition, and
  policy diffusion. The 0.7 development line uses a Rust scientific core, Polars
  tables, and Python, Julia, and R bindings. Native migration and scientific
  qualification remain in progress; this metadata does not claim a qualified release.
